OL,3,AUK inflation rate rises to 3.5% after
OL,4,Afuel prices surge
OL,5,
OL,6,FInflation increased to 3.5% in the year
OL,7,Fto September, new figures from the
OL,8,FOffice for National Statistics (ONS)
OL,9,Fshow, driven by rising fuel prices
OL,11,FRising cost of airfares also
OL,12,Fcontributed to the uptick, and to a
OL,13,Flesser extent, the cost of going to
OL,14,Flive events
OL,16,FThe update comes ahead of the Budget
OL,17,Fnext week - Chancellor John Healey is
OL,18,Flikely to have little extra spare cash
OL,19,Fto provide "breathing space" for
OL,20,Fhouseholds, says our deputy economics
OL,21,Feditor
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
