OL,3,AUK inflation rate rises to 3.5% after
OL,4,Afuel prices surge
OL,5,
OL,6,FToday's rate will be used as a
OL,7,Fbenchmark for an increase in benefits
OL,8,Fcome next April - find out more here
OL,10,FInflation measures the increase in the
OL,11,Fprice of something over time - the Bank
OL,12,Fof England has a target of keeping the
OL,13,Frate at 2%
